{"term": {"label": "親", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 9, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "務", "id": "務"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "忘", "id": "忘"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "挾", "id": "挾"}, {"form": "放", "id": "放"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "親", "variants": [], "id": "親"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "信", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.856470206220483, "source": "信", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.367295829986474, "source": "信", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 3.367295829986474, "source": "挾", "target": "問"}, {"weight": 1.7578579175523736, "source": "挾", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.9618307218783095, "source": "忘", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "忘", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.268683541318364, "source": "忘", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.0159205728229963, "source": "忘", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.13370360847938, "source": "親", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 0.648195792697679, "source": "親", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.6727001092120668, "source": "親", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.16862271243579272, "source": "親", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.6037072377251154, "source": "親", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.16862271243579272, "source": "親", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.5199979695992702, "source": "親", "target": "務"}, {"weight": 2.11453286149110